1
00:00:00,819 --> 00:00:05,119
(Penny:)...he can't go here
because of my pointy-head guy.

2
00:00:05,907 --> 00:00:08,617
(Leonard:)Like I said, complicated game.

3
00:00:09,536 --> 00:00:11,456
- So did I win or not?
- Did you have fun?

4
00:00:11,663 --> 00:00:13,793
(Leonard:)Because if you had fun,
then you are a winner.

5
00:00:13,999 --> 00:00:16,079
(Leonard:)That's what chess is all about.

6
00:00:18,128 --> 00:00:19,168
- Hello.
- Hey.

7
00:00:19,379 --> 00:00:21,339
(Penny:)Oh, hey. Sorry, Sheldon, I'll move.

8
00:00:21,548 --> 00:00:25,008
(Sheldon:)Why? My spot, your spot.
What difference does it make?

9
00:00:28,888 --> 00:00:32,598
- Okay, what just happened?
- l don't know.

10
00:00:32,809 --> 00:00:35,019
(Leonard:)Between you playing chess
like Bobby Fischer...

11
00:00:35,228 --> 00:00:37,648
(Leonard:)...and Sheldon being okay
with you in his spot...

12
00:00:37,856 --> 00:00:39,936
(Leonard:)...I'm guessing
someone went back in time...

13
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:43,150
(Leonard:)...stepped on a bug,
and changed the course of human events.

14
00:00:44,529 --> 00:00:48,449
(Penny:)- Sweetie, are you all right?
- No, I'm not all right.

15
00:00:48,658 --> 00:00:51,448
(Sheldon:)It's been six days
since I was supposed to get a haircut...

16
00:00:51,661 --> 00:00:53,491
(Sheldon:)...and nothing horrible has happened.

17
00:00:54,831 --> 00:00:56,581
(Penny:)Okay, I'm sorry, I don't understand.

18
00:00:57,292 --> 00:01:03,022
- Leonard, explain it to her.
- Oh, uh, he's crazy.

